<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">What Lingers in the Shadows</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;She-Ra is the biggest hero in all of Bright Moon. Sheâ€™s a household name, an inspiration, a celebrity, a face no soul canâ€™t recognize. Yet, they know nothing about her. Day and night she operates, underneath carefully coordinated government plans. She runs from one end of the city to the next in a blink, performing miracles left and right. Sheâ€™s there for every danger, every threat opposed to the modern man. She takes the punches, puffs her chest out against danger. Other than She-Raâ€™s secretive identity, thousands ask the question: how does she do it? Isnâ€™t she tired? When will she reach her breaking point?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;How much longer will she be able to protect the city like this?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>stingingscorpion</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
